                <row><cell>On-Level Learners (Core)</cell><cell>Full activity and both examples. Assign <xref ref="ex-midpoint-locus-radius"/> to <xref ref="ex-centre-of-a-tank"/>.</cell></row>
                <row><cell>Advanced Learners (Challenge)</cell><cell>All exercises including <xref ref="ex-chords-through-a-point"/>.</cell></row>
            </tabular>
        </table>
    </axiom>

